{"2272540": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "FBC: Firebreak", "steam_appid": 2272540, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "dlc": [3625720], "detailed_description": "<h1>Friend's Pass</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2272540/extras/ec46413a94b023b8c8dae7d67cd09e09.avif?t=1773771620\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >FBC: Firebreak is a cooperative first-person shooter set within a mysterious federal agency under assault by otherworldly forces. As a years-long siege on the agency’s headquarters reaches a breakpoint, only Firebreak— the Bureau’s most versatile unit—has the gear and the guts to plunge into the building’s strangest crises, restore order, contain the chaos, and fight to reclaim control. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2272540/extras/45b330afc6fa3a9e6fbb525ffebd22a3.avif?t=1773771620\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2272540/extras_big/45b330afc6fa3a9e6fbb525ffebd22a3.avif?t=1773771620 width=800 height=84 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into the Federal Bureau of Control’s (FBC) unpredictable and extradimensional headquarters during its darkest—and strangest—hours. As one of the FBC’s fearless first responders, you and your team are on call to confront everything from reality-warping anomalies to otherworldly monsters... no matter the odds. Will you contain the chaos or finally lose control?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2272540/extras/7f2f41aaf022765bda604c61ebb07f09.poster.avif?t=1773771620\" width=640 height=306 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2272540/extras/7f2f41aaf022765bda604c61ebb07f09.webm?t=1773771620\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2272540/extras/7f2f41aaf022765bda604c61ebb07f09.mp4?t=1773771620\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2272540/extras/f5710d1dfb1410af47f594a84b52d4c1.avif?t=1773771620\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2272540/extras_big/f5710d1dfb1410af47f594a84b52d4c1.avif?t=1773771620 width=800 height=88 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join forces with friends or strangers to tackle each crisis as a well-oiled crew. Survival in this three-player cooperative FPS hinges on quick thinking and seamless teamwork as you scramble to tame raging paranatural crises across a variety of unexpected locations. Improve your odds by utilizing the tools and skills that make you unique or improvising with whatever’s on hand to support your crew.    </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2272540/extras/f81986458c35bffad55e91e6d2afcba8.poster.avif?t=1773771620\" width=640 height=306 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2272540/extras/f81986458c35bffad55e91e6d2afcba8.webm?t=1773771620\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2272540/extras/f81986458c35bffad55e91e6d2afcba8.mp4?t=1773771620\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2272540/extras/e6fa4210683dc4fa4a899285f01ff710.avif?t=1773771620\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2272540/extras_big/e6fa4210683dc4fa4a899285f01ff710.avif?t=1773771620 width=800 height=82 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Before deploying, select your weapon and customize your Firebreaker’s Crisis Kit with specialized tools, grenades, support items, and paranatural augments... then modify them to suit your strategy and change the way you play. Experiment with different loadouts to perfect your playstyle and synergize with your team, giving you the edge to succeed in every crisis, no matter the difficulty.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2272540/extras/c63cecbba309aa752964164209eab414.poster.avif?t=1773771620\" width=640 height=306 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2272540/extras/c63cecbba309aa752964164209eab414.webm?t=1773771620\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2272540/extras/c63cecbba309aa752964164209eab414.mp4?t=1773771620\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2272540/extras/10940933f35c0e14386091d8e232c31a.avif?t=1773771620\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2272540/extras_big/10940933f35c0e14386091d8e232c31a.avif?t=1773771620 width=800 height=93 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Return to the strange and unexpected world of Control or venture in for the first time in this standalone, multiplayer experience. Discover the iconic and unfathomable headquarters of the FBC — the Oldest House — from an entirely new perspective as a team of volunteer first responders who'll stop at nothing to save what's left of the Bureau.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2272540/extras/cc1f9bfe45cf3292e1eae3686f6a54e9.poster.avif?t=1773771620\" width=640 height=306 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2272540/extras/cc1f9bfe45cf3292e1eae3686f6a54e9.webm?t=1773771620\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2272540/extras/cc1f9bfe45cf3292e1eae3686f6a54e9.mp4?t=1773771620\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >FBC: Firebreak is a cooperative first-person shooter set within a mysterious federal agency under assault by otherworldly forces. As a years-long siege on the agency’s headquarters reaches a breakpoint, only Firebreak— the Bureau’s most versatile unit—has the gear and the guts to plunge into the building’s strangest crises, restore order, contain the chaos, and fight to reclaim control. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2272540/extras/45b330afc6fa3a9e6fbb525ffebd22a3.avif?t=1773771620\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2272540/extras_big/45